-- title:
--   Decay bound for the coefficients a^+ of the Gaussian Toeplitz inverse
-- statement:
--   Let $\alpha \ge 2$, $\sigma \ge 1$ and $\theta \le \sigma - 2|b|$. Then for every $h \in \mathbb N$ the coefficient $a^{+}_h$ of the explicit inverse of the real Gaussian Toeplitz block satisfies
--
--   $$|a^{+}_h| \le 1.0001\, e^{-\pi \alpha^2 \theta h}.$$
--
